This is a fork of the Ramses code on my Bitbucket account,
obtained via:

$> git clone https://tepper@bitbucket.org/tepper/ramses.git


It is the (ideally) latest version of Ramses available
through Bitbucket:

$> git clone https://bitbucket.org/rteyssie/ramses

I try my best to keep the latter up-to-date via:

$> git remote update; git status

And in case of new commits:

$> git pull

NOTE: This copy may containf my own changes in the form
of patches, which are however not sent for pull requests
from the main repo.
It may be tricky to keep up to date but I'll try...

